{"type":"standard","title":"Josh Turek","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Josh Turek</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q108470940","titles":{"canonical":"Josh_Turek","normalized":"Josh Turek","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Josh Turek</span></span>"},"pageid":68681546,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Joshua_Turek_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/330px-Joshua_Turek_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":463},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/Joshua_Turek_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1200,"height":1683},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383573074","tid":"4b0b18b4-d780-11f1-9296-8249e5e39d5c","timestamp":"2026-11-03T12:15:44Z","description":"American politician and wheelchair basketball player","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Turek","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Turek?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Turek?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Josh_Turek"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Turek","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Josh_Turek","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Josh_Turek?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Josh_Turek"}},"extract":"Joshua Peter Turek is an American politician and former wheelchair basketball player who has served since 2023 as a member of the Iowa House of Representatives from the 20th district. A member of the Democratic Party, he is the party's nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Iowa.","extract_html":"<p><b>Joshua Peter Turek</b> is an American politician and former wheelchair basketball player who has served since 2023 as a member of the Iowa House of Representatives from the 20th district. A member of the Democratic Party, he is the party's nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Iowa.</p>"}